    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist &amp; Beta</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/af33f3edbf603de7b7af6a277278befc.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhilarating Free-For-All Matches:</strong></h2>Dive into high-energy, fast-paced 4-player free-for-all showdowns where only the most cunning and quick-witted will emerge victorious.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/2b119a512d293b1b8f3f4ac000d2a789.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/2b119a512d293b1b8f3f4ac000d2a789.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/2b119a512d293b1b8f3f4ac000d2a789.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rewarding Unlockables:</strong> </h2>Collect cake to unlock new characters, skins, titles, and more, look good feel good. Extensive customization, personalize your character and trouble powers with numerous build options to outsmart your foes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/7c7cd50359128fc4e7383e40edc5afe2.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/7c7cd50359128fc4e7383e40edc5afe2.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/7c7cd50359128fc4e7383e40edc5afe2.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibrant Character Roster:</h2>Choose from a unique and colorful cast of Trouble Makers. Pick between 8 different Trouble Makers. Each of them having their own unique TROUBLE. Become the Trouble Maker you were born to be!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/8efa7faca0523d8971382578fb3638ab.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/8efa7faca0523d8971382578fb3638ab.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/8efa7faca0523d8971382578fb3638ab.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Multiplayer Battles:</h2>Unleash trouble on opponents in various survival scenarios. Wreak havoc with dust devils, crone strikes, lava, and more to take out other players and be the last one standing. collect the TROUBLE crystals to build up the TROUBLE bar. Once you have enough make TROUBLE for your opponents... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/003e1c11d0a5afe824fcf2d034b31c50.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/003e1c11d0a5afe824fcf2d034b31c50.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/003e1c11d0a5afe824fcf2d034b31c50.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhilarating Free-For-All Matches:</strong></h2>Dive into high-energy, fast-paced 4-player free-for-all showdowns where only the most cunning and quick-witted will emerge victorious.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/2b119a512d293b1b8f3f4ac000d2a789.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/2b119a512d293b1b8f3f4ac000d2a789.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/2b119a512d293b1b8f3f4ac000d2a789.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rewarding Unlockables:</strong> </h2>Collect cake to unlock new characters, skins, titles, and more, look good feel good. Extensive customization, personalize your character and trouble powers with numerous build options to outsmart your foes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/7c7cd50359128fc4e7383e40edc5afe2.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/7c7cd50359128fc4e7383e40edc5afe2.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/7c7cd50359128fc4e7383e40edc5afe2.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibrant Character Roster:</h2>Choose from a unique and colorful cast of Trouble Makers. Pick between 8 different Trouble Makers. Each of them having their own unique TROUBLE. Become the Trouble Maker you were born to be!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/8efa7faca0523d8971382578fb3638ab.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/8efa7faca0523d8971382578fb3638ab.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/8efa7faca0523d8971382578fb3638ab.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Multiplayer Battles:</h2>Unleash trouble on opponents in various survival scenarios. Wreak havoc with dust devils, crone strikes, lava, and more to take out other players and be the last one standing. collect the TROUBLE crystals to build up the TROUBLE bar. Once you have enough make TROUBLE for your opponents... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/003e1c11d0a5afe824fcf2d034b31c50.poster.avif?t=1748120585\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/003e1c11d0a5afe824fcf2d034b31c50.webm?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915210/extras/003e1c11d0a5afe824fcf2d034b31c50.mp4?t=1748120585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
